W503,E273 	tab after keyword
W503,E274 	tab before keyword
W503,E275 	missing whitespace after keyword
--- flake8 --ignore F40
F401 	NAME imported but unused
F402 	import NAME from line NAME shadowed by loop variable
F403 	'from NAME import *' used; unable to detect undefined names
F404 	from __future__ imports must occur at the beginning of the file
F405 	NAME may be undefined, or defined from star imports: NAME
F406 	'from NAME import *' only allowed at module level
F407 	future feature NAME is not defined
--- flake8 --format 
default 
pylint 
quiet-filename 
quiet-nothing 
--- flake8 --color=
--color=always 
--color=auto 
--color=never 
--- flake8 --max-
--max-complexity=	the McCabe complexity threshold
--max-doc-length=	maximum allowed doc line length for the entirety of this run
--max-line-length=	maximum allowed line length for the entirety of this run
=== autopep8
--- autopep8 
pkg/
setup.py 
--- autopep8 --select 
E 	pycodestyle errors
W 	pycodestyle warnings
--- autopep8 --ignore E7
E701 	put colon-separated compound statement on separate lines
E702 	put semicolon-separated compound statement on separate lines
E703 	put semicolon-separated compound statement on separate lines
E704 	fix multiple statements on one line def
E711 	fix comparison with None
E712 	fix (trivial case of) comparison with boolean
E713 	fix (trivial case of) non-membership check
E714 	fix object identity should be 'is not' case
E721 	fix comparison type
E722 	fix bare except
E731 	fix do not assign a lambda expression check
--- autopep8 --in
--in-place 	make changes to files in place
--- autopep8 --line-range 
